      "text": "CRITICAL PROPERTY:\n  Infrastructure systems are INTERDEPENDENT\n  Failure in one often cascades to others\n  The interdependency graph is not a tree -- it contains cycles\n  Cycles mean cascading failures can loop and amplify"
    },
    {
      "id": "00-OVERVIEW.md#007",
