        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Infrastructure Systems - Landscape Overview",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "LIFECYCLE:\n  Plan -> Design -> Finance -> Build -> Commission -> Operate -> Maintain -> Retire\n  Each phase: different risk profile, different stakeholders, different failure modes\n  US infrastructure is concentrated in the \"Operate/Maintain\" phase\n  (built mostly 1950-1980; 40-70 year old assets)\n```"
