        "title": "Infrastructure Systems - Landscape Overview",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Specific dependencies:\n  Electric power -> water: pumps, treatment chemicals injection, SCADA control\n  Water -> electric: cooling water for thermal plants, hydroelectric\n  Telecom -> everything: SCADA, HVAC, financial transactions, 911\n  Transport -> everything: fuel delivery, goods, workers, repair crews\n  Healthcare -> electric: life support, HVAC, cold chain for drugs/blood"
    },
